    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/meta/pyre-check/tarball/v0.9.11",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/meta/pyre-check/zipball/v0.9.11",
    "body": "- Better source location if there are type errors within type comments.\r\n- Basic support for PEP 681 (dataclass transforms).\r\n- Prototype support for LSP hovering and goto-definition (needs to opt-in via configuration but this may change in the future).\r\n- Basic support for PEP 561 (needs to opt-in via configuration but this may change in the future).\r\n- Parsing is now performed lazily. This should significantly reduce the type checking time for small projects. "
  },
